# Credits

CT License Trail does not vendor a crossword engine, a PWA starter, or a speech library. The grid, the study text, the clues, and the illustrations are original to this project. No copyrighted game art, textbook text, or paid-prep questions are included.

Official Connecticut and federal sources linked from the question bank are cited in the README. Those pages are references, not copied into the app.

## Deploy workflow

GitHub Pages is published by `.github/workflows/pages.yml`. That workflow calls these MIT-licensed actions. They are not copied into this repository. GitHub fetches them when the workflow runs.

| Action | Pin | License | Repository |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| actions/checkout | v4 | MIT | https://github.com/actions/checkout |
| actions/configure-pages | v5 | MIT | https://github.com/actions/configure-pages |
| actions/upload-pages-artifact | v3 | MIT | https://github.com/actions/upload-pages-artifact |
| actions/deploy-pages | v4 | MIT | https://github.com/actions/deploy-pages |

The MIT license text for each action is in that repository.

